      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 828733013,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Marking as a draft because I'm not sure if this is the correct fix. It fixes #17842 here, but according to the ATN ULCS spec, a sequence of nulls is [perfectly valid](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/dissectors/asn1/atn-ulcs/atn-ulcs.asn#L431).",
