        {
          "id": 829756159,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "I think we should keep it at 50 for now. For ATN ULCS, this is 50 * 3 proto tree items:\n\n```\n                            RelativeDistinguishedName: 15805 items\n                                Item 0\n                                    AttributeTypeAndValue\n                                        null: NULL\n                                Item 1\n                                    AttributeTypeAndValue\n                                        null: NULL\n```\n\nI'm tempted to set it to 1, since encoding 2 or more NULLs seems silly but I'm not a PER expert. It's easy enough to change later.",
          "author": {
