      "title": "ASN.1 PER + ATN-ULCS: Add checks for nulls in sequences.",
      "message": "ASN.1 PER + ATN-ULCS: Add checks for nulls in sequences.\n\nIn ASN.1 PER, Stop dissection if our sequence offset hasn't advanced\nafter 50 items.\n\natn-ulcs.asn overrides the definition of AttributeTypeAndValue as a\nsequence of NULLs. Update our .cnf file so that we only dissect the\nfirst item in that case.\n\nFixes #17842.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2022-02-01T18:44:42.000-08:00",
      "committer_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "committer_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
